{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\uff08Note: The translation of the demo version is incomplete, but the official version is complete\uff09</u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever envied the abilities of bosses in games? Frustrated by being unable to beat them because their powers are just too overwhelming?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594590/extras/2ead6a1248ee8707452dc799094da9e2.avif?t=1770277962\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594590/extras_big/2ead6a1248ee8707452dc799094da9e2.avif?t=1770277962 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great! In this game, you can seize your enemies' abilities, skills, and even followers lock, stock and barrel! Now let's see who the real boss is!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594590/extras/cf69566c58cc28a6f8a29ed5522be0e9.poster.avif?t=1770277962\" width=856 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594590/extras/cf69566c58cc28a6f8a29ed5522be0e9.webm?t=1770277962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594590/extras/cf69566c58cc28a6f8a29ed5522be0e9.mp4?t=1770277962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(What's yours is mine)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594590/extras/cc425b3aacb470e5120632d545e0a9f9.poster.avif?t=1770277962\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594590/extras/cc425b3aacb470e5120632d545e0a9f9.webm?t=1770277962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't loot you claim after the battle ends - you can snatch it right before the fight even begins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That means you can not only seize enemies' powers to build your own arsenal, but also disrupt their ability combos, or even strip them of all their skills and leave them powerless. It's bound to be an exhilarating experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594590/extras/8a819caf3f1dc06096e4617f31eff261.avif?t=1770277962\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seize the powers of the gods and climb your way to becoming the strongest being in the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you'll encounter more than 50 unique enemies, each with at least 5 exclusive abilities designed just for them. Combined, they create over 300 distinct abilities that you can mix and match!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594590/extras/16ba603a48aecfac274d529638aae51a.avif?t=1770277962\" width=1108 height=872 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both you and your enemies will grow in strength at a breakneck pace as you progress. Experience the thrill of power scaling with the perfect combo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the protagonist's seizing ability, two additional characters with completely unique playstyles will be unlocked later in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each protagonist features three entirely distinct playstyles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594590/extras/b9f9dc01ea9b127cb83a1e5e59398978.avif?t=1770277962\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The False Mirror - Annie</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She wields the power of mirror replication, allowing her to copy enemies' abilities in a symmetrical fashion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594590/extras/f31fe0cb630991c0571c8456514a109f.avif?t=1770277962\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And there's another... well, a mysterious character who wishes to remain unnamed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A being with the power of creation and destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After clearing the normal stage mode, you'll unlock the totally unique [Critter Duel] mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a mode I've been eager to add ever since the game was first conceptualized!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the bosses that always hound you battle each other and guess who's the strongest - it's sure to be a ton of fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Awakening","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3594590/31a265644d8ca317c6dad2164910fcc87c610aa3.jpg"},{"name":"Too Soft-Hearted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3594590/fc581c7877f229d3437043a571cd4de3f72ad7e3.jpg"},{"name":"Killed in Tutorial","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3594590/ba1156657f72c5a2e1ae3873c88e23959c190888.jpg"},{"name":"Greed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3594590/87a2175b4af72f3f378de6374d57222baba56e08.jpg"},{"name":"Double Image","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3594590/3b747f852e5f3613b1416c0c645cc33ced4a9b95.jpg"},{"name":"Magic Mirror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3594590/9bf71c6bb4ba2282d444e5c6712786ac2f939eea.jpg"},{"name":"False","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3594590/541faa3f528edd81c8c16034bb9e14a6333460b7.jpg"},{"name":"Forgery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3594590/1d68db94e0712d4beb1d8064e3d194ebafd0ec7d.jpg"},{"name":"Lie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3594590/7f62c3a5170af025b0114d64b410f1bf63beb381.jpg"},{"name":"End of All Things","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3594590/74527a90d345bd4bb5d4c0731904c125ea7b0528.jpg"}],"total":57},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3594590?t=1770277962","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594590/e01d13ef56195195db51f81d7c848a047cc27f56/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770277962","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594590/5779ef7cbd98d3e72397cecda289c84138b13685/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770277962","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594590/5779ef7cbd98d3e72397cecda289c84138b13685/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770277962","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3599370,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\uff08Note: The translation of the demo version is incomplete, but the official version is complete\uff09</u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever envied the abilities of bosses in games? Frustrated by being unable to beat them because their powers are just too overwhelming?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594590/extras/2ead6a1248ee8707452dc799094da9e2.avif?t=1770277962\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594590/extras_big/2ead6a1248ee8707452dc799094da9e2.avif?t=1770277962 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great! In this game, you can seize your enemies' abilities, skills, and even followers lock, stock and barrel! Now let's see who the real boss is!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594590/extras/cf69566c58cc28a6f8a29ed5522be0e9.poster.avif?t=1770277962\" width=856 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594590/extras/cf69566c58cc28a6f8a29ed5522be0e9.webm?t=1770277962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594590/extras/cf69566c58cc28a6f8a29ed5522be0e9.mp4?t=1770277962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(What's yours is mine)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594590/extras/cc425b3aacb470e5120632d545e0a9f9.poster.avif?t=1770277962\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594590/extras/cc425b3aacb470e5120632d545e0a9f9.webm?t=1770277962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't loot you claim after the battle ends - you can snatch it right before the fight even begins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That means you can not only seize enemies' powers to build your own arsenal, but also disrupt their ability combos, or even strip them of all their skills and leave them powerless. It's bound to be an exhilarating experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594590/extras/8a819caf3f1dc06096e4617f31eff261.avif?t=1770277962\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seize the powers of the gods and climb your way to becoming the strongest being in the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you'll encounter more than 50 unique enemies, each with at least 5 exclusive abilities designed just for them. Combined, they create over 300 distinct abilities that you can mix and match!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594590/extras/16ba603a48aecfac274d529638aae51a.avif?t=1770277962\" width=1108 height=872 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both you and your enemies will grow in strength at a breakneck pace as you progress. Experience the thrill of power scaling with the perfect combo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the protagonist's seizing ability, two additional characters with completely unique playstyles will be unlocked later in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each protagonist features three entirely distinct playstyles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594590/extras/b9f9dc01ea9b127cb83a1e5e59398978.avif?t=1770277962\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The False Mirror - Annie</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She wields the power of mirror replication, allowing her to copy enemies' abilities in a symmetrical fashion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594590/extras/f31fe0cb630991c0571c8456514a109f.avif?t=1770277962\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And there's another... well, a mysterious character who wishes to remain unnamed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A being with the power of creation and destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After clearing the normal stage mode, you'll unlock the totally unique [Critter Duel] mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a mode I've been eager to add ever since the game was first conceptualized!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the bosses that always hound you battle each other and guess who's the strongest - it's sure to be a ton of fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["\u58a8\u5143\u7d20"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594590/fb5d54921234133c57e4a87888d49765f7550bc7/header.jpg?t=1770277962","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>R